## Forbidden Modifications (Read-Only Context)
  - app/(store)/basket/**          # Basket UI — no changes
  - app/(store)/checkout/shipping/ # Shipping UI — no changes (except G-01/G-02 guards)
  - app/(store)/checkout/return/   # Return UI — no changes
  - sanity/schemaTypes/            # Sanity schemas — no changes
  - store/store.ts                 # Zustand store — no changes
  - lib/stripe/                    # Stripe client config — no changes
  - tailwind.config.ts             # Design tokens — no changes
  - All existing tests outside tests/e2e/checkout/ — no changes

## Allowed Write Scope
  - tests/e2e/checkout/**          # NEW: All 36 spec files + fixtures
  - app/api/webhook/route.ts       # FIX: SG-01 (atomic order+stock), SG-02 (reservedStock guard)
  - playwright.config.ts           # UPDATE: Project config per §2 of 03_audit
  - package.json                   # UPDATE: npm scripts per §2.2 of 03_audit
  - README.md                      # UPDATE: Portfolio section per §4 of 03_audit

## Anti-Patterns (REJECT if observed)
  - ❌ Modifying checkout UI components to make tests pass
  - ❌ Adding test-only attributes to production components
  - ❌ Testing framework behavior instead of application behavior
  - ❌ Tests with >1 assertion per test case
  - ❌ Tests that depend on external state (Stripe live mode, real Sanity data)
  - ❌ Mixing UI tests with API tests in same spec file

