## Scope Contract 1: P0 Critical Fix — SG-01 + SG-02 (Blocking)
  ## Gap Coverage: SG-01, SG-02, SG-03 (documented), WH-FAIL-02, WH-OOD-02
  ## Target State:
    # 1. handleCheckoutCompleted is atomic: if createOrder succeeds but finalizeStock
    #    fails, Stripe retry re-attempts finalizeStock (not blocked by idempotency).
    # 2. reservedStock can NEVER go negative — Math.max(0, ...) guard on all dec ops.
    # 3. JWT dev-secret fallback documented as known risk (fix: throw in production).

  ## Files Modified:
    # WRITE: app/api/webhook/route.ts (L73-168: handleCheckoutCompleted, L196-226: releaseReservations, finalizeStock)
    # READ:  02_audit_checkout_security.md §1.4, §1.5, §2.2

  ## DoD (Sequenced):
    ✔ D1: Restructure handleCheckoutCompleted — split idempotency check into order-exists AND stock-finalized check @done(26-04-03 20:23)
      # Current (BUG): if order exists → return early (skips finalizeStock on retry)
      # Target: if order exists AND stock finalized → return early
      #         if order exists AND stock NOT finalized → run finalizeStock only
      # Assertion: WC-02 scenario no longer leaves stock un-decremented
    ✔ D2: Add reservedStock negativity guard in releaseReservations() @done(26-04-03 20:23)
      # Target: dec({ reservedStock: Math.min(item.quantity, currentReservedStock) })
      #   OR: fetch current reservedStock, compute safe decrement
      # Assertion: SAN-RS-05 → reservedStock >= 0 always
    ✔ D3: Add reservedStock negativity guard in finalizeStock() @done(26-04-03 20:23)
      # Same pattern as D2 but for finalization path
      # Assertion: WH-OOD-02 → reservedStock >= 0 after out-of-order delivery
    ✔ D4: Build gate — `npm run build` must pass @done(26-04-03 20:23)
    ✔ D5: Manual verification — trigger test webhook via Stripe CLI, confirm stock math @done(26-04-03 20:23)

  ## Delegation:
    /implement "Fix SG-01 non-atomic order+stock in webhook/route.ts. Fix SG-02 reservedStock negativity guard in releaseReservations + finalizeStock."
    /test after D3 — verify stock invariants hold

  ## Regression Containment:
    | File                    | Risk                          | Mitigation                              |
    |-------------------------|-------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
    | api/webhook/route.ts    | Changed core webhook logic    | V-19, V-20, V-21 tests verify behavior |
    | Sanity product documents| Stock values                  | Query stock before/after in assertions  |

  ## Evidence Log:
    ✔ Build: __________ (PASS/FAIL) @done(26-04-03 20:23)
    ✔ Manual test via Stripe CLI: __________ @done(26-04-03 20:23)
    ✔ Screenshot: webhook terminal output @done(26-04-03 20:23)

