## Execution Order (Strict — No Reordering)
  1. SC-1  (P0 Critical Fix)     → SG-01 + SG-02 bug fixes (BLOCKING)
  2. SC-9  (Config + Fixtures)   → Infrastructure for all subsequent tests
  3. SC-2  (API Tests)           → Fastest feedback loop, no browser needed
  4. SC-3  (Webhook Tests)       → Server-side proof, builds on SC-1 fixes
  5. SC-4  (Stock Tests)         → Builds on SC-2 + SC-3 infrastructure
  6. SC-5  (Guards + Worst-Case) → Builds on all server tests
  7. SC-6  (Guest Journey)       → First full UI journey
  8. SC-7  (Auth Journey)        → Second full UI journey, builds on SC-6 patterns
  9. SC-8  (Shipping Tests)      → Documents current state + future scaffold
  10. SC-10 (Portfolio + Proof)   → Final verification — SPRINT LOCK

## Per Scope Contract Gate
  REPEAT for each SC-N:
    1. /implement "[SC-N scope]"
    2. /test → evidence dashboard
    3. Build gate: `npm run build` → must PASS
    4. Mark SC-N complete ✅ only when ALL DoDs pass
    5. Proceed to SC-N+1

